<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113104" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			13.375
		</span></i>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>containing copper,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος χ.</span>
			<i>copper-ore,</i> worked in Cyprus, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				552b10
			</span></i>; and in Euboea, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.434a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a mineral,
				<i>rock-alum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.32
			</span></i> (sed v. foreg.), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. στυπτηρίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ulc.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κυανέη</span> (of doubtful
			nature) ib.<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσάνθεμον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.58
			</span></i>.</div>
